### Create scenario
POST http://localhost:4000/api/scenarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "E-commerce ramp test",
  "targetSystemId": "{{targetId}}",
  "behaviorModelId": "{{modelId}}",
  "trafficPattern": {
    "type": "ramp",
    "startAgents": 100,
    "endAgents": 5000,
    "durationMs": 300000
  }
}

### List scenarios
GET http://localhost:4000/api/scenarios

### Submit run
POST http://localhost:4000/api/scenarios/{{scenarioId}}/runs
